+  --claims SPEC.inner-loop,SPEC.outer-loop \
+  --trusted SPEC.inner-loop
+```
+
+Actual proof result: `#Top`, exit 0. The trusted label is exactly the claim
+proved by positive target 1.
+
+Positive target 3:
