+```text
+primeFibSearch(N, 0, 0, 1)
+```
+
+versus the false destination:
+
+```text
+primeFibSearch(N, 0, 0, 1) +Int 1
+```
+
+Body-sensitivity probe:
+
+```bash
+kprove spec-body-mutation.k \
+  --definition verification-kompiled \
+  --spec-module SPEC-BODY-MUTATION \
